# Human-in-the-Loop (HITL)
- Always implement HITL feedback checkpoints in workflow-critical functions
- Include user approval mechanisms for all major planning stages
- Properly track contributions from each agent for user review
- Implement graceful handling of user feedback and corrections
- Provide clear notifications when HITL input is required
- Store and utilize human feedback for future improvements
- Make all HITL approval settings configurable via environment variables
- Implement user-friendly interfaces for reviewing agent outputs
- Allow partial approvals of multi-step plans
- Include status indicators for awaiting human input

# Model API Compatibility
- Ensure all API endpoints support both OpenAI and LM Studio formats
- Check for environment variables before accessing API keys
- Provide clear error messages for missing API configuration
- Include fallback mechanisms when specific API services are unavailable
- Support graceful degradation when token limits are exceeded
- Implement rate limiting and retry logic for API calls
- Use appropriate temperature settings for different agent roles
- Implement proper error handling for network failures during API calls
- Configure model-specific prompt formatting
- Handle context window limitations appropriately
- Support streaming responses where appropriate

# Multi-Agent Coordination
- Implement clear role separation and responsibilities between agent types
- Design explicit transition conditions between agent nodes in the workflow graph
- Ensure consistent message passing and context preservation between agents
- Implement logging for all inter-agent communications
- Design deadlock detection and resolution mechanisms in the agent workflow
- Implement progress tracking and timeout mechanisms
- Use standardized formats for sharing data between agents
- Implement agent memory to avoid redundant operations
- Implement supervisor oversight for conflict resolution
- Design fallback paths in the workflow graph
- Allow dynamic agent selection based on task requirements

